So we get that  $FTAX$  is a cyclic quarilateral and as  $PE\|AK$  we get by Reim's Theorem that  $ETPE$  is also cyclic  $\implies \angle TPE=90^\circ$  and as  $(TE;BC)=-1$  we get that  $PE$  bisects  $\angle BPC$ .  $\blacksquare$

