First, we will provide a construction for  $56$  kings.   $$ \begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|} \hline
\bullet&\bullet& &\bullet&\bullet& &\bullet&\bullet& &\bullet& &\bullet \hline
